{
  "total_ms": 58780,
  "total_chars": 249,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "霜打过的白菜晾在院子里，老辈人这几天就开始刷大缸了——今天小雪。",
      "chars": 32,
      "speech_ms": 6800,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 6800,
      "trace_id": "07487559ae0cdc2a6e442fa87cbe1f93"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "老话说，小雪腌菜，大雪腌肉。",
      "chars": 14,
      "speech_ms": 3170,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 7200,
      "end_ms": 10370,
      "trace_id": "074875604c122ad8c34b6d420d93b35a"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "有些地方，就有小雪前后腌菜的习惯。",
      "chars": 17,
      "speech_ms": 3260,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 10770,
      "end_ms": 14030,
      "trace_id": "074875664b7180e4a041a1b881cc0e72"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "为啥赶在这个节气？一是菜正当时：霜打过的白菜、萝卜、雪里蕻，水分足、味道厚；",
      "chars": 38,
      "speech_ms": 9970,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 14430,
      "end_ms": 24400,
      "trace_id": "0748756d5212c59fab13802dbf2395da"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "二是天渐渐冷了，老辈人说，这个时候下缸，心里踏实。",
      "chars": 25,
      "speech_ms": 5440,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 24800,
      "end_ms": 30240,
      "trace_id": "07487573617c1f9b78f297c12ff5c360"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "过去没有冰箱，一缸咸菜，就是一家人冬天的一份储备。",
      "chars": 25,
      "speech_ms": 4980,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 30640,
      "end_ms": 35620,
      "trace_id": "074875790492a12a99fef16ba9d34d76"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "各家做法不一样：有干腌的，有做泡菜的，泡菜讲究坛沿那圈水勤看着点儿。",
      "chars": 34,
      "speech_ms": 8360,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 36020,
      "end_ms": 44380,
      "trace_id": "07487580397a69cc961639f59e44be76"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "如今什么菜都买得到，可不少老人到小雪还是要腌上一缸——腌的不是菜，是过日子的节奏，是老辈人迎冬的讲究。",
      "chars": 51,
      "speech_ms": 10930,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 44780,
      "end_ms": 55710,
      "trace_id": "0748758657e053267dca23f63a88ffb6"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "您家今年腌了吗？",
      "chars": 8,
      "speech_ms": 1270,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 56110,
      "end_ms": 57380,
      "trace_id": "0748758df915524395edea7158bcea38"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "腌的什么？",
      "chars": 5,
      "speech_ms": 620,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 57780,
      "end_ms": 58400,
      "trace_id": "07487593d6c797a914b9e48cde5a4889"
    }
  ]
}